This repository holds the code, figures, and datasets behind AQLI annual reports and factsheets. An open license has not been selected. Until AQLI publishes one, no permission is granted to copy, modify, or redistribute the code or the data beyond what applicable law already allows.

The open question is whether a future license covers code only, or code and the published datasets. That choice belongs to AQLI.
